      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/ImePhilippines/status/1984835735783121335",
      "text": "🔥𝐓𝐎𝐃𝐀𝐘 𝐈𝐒 𝐃–𝐃𝐀𝐘! 🔥\n\nThe wait is OVER — the MAGIC unfolds TONIGHT! ✨\n\nManila, get ready to experience 𝐉𝐀𝐂𝐊𝐒𝐎𝐍 𝐖𝐀𝐍𝐆: 𝐌𝐀𝐆𝐈𝐂 𝐌𝐀𝐍 𝟐 𝐖𝐎𝐑𝐋𝐃 𝐓𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟓–𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟔 — a night of fire, art, and emotion that will set the Araneta Coliseum ablaze! 💥\n\nThis is the moment we’ve all been waiting for. The stage is ready. The energy is rising. The MAGIC begins now. ⚡️\n\n📍 Venue: Araneta Coliseum\n 📅 Date: November 2, 2025 (Sunday)\n ⏰ Time: 7:00 PM\n\nLet’s make history together, Manila — it’s your time to shine with Jackson Wang! 🌟\n#MAGICMAN2WORLDTOUR #JACKSONWANGWORLDTOUR #잭슨 #王嘉尔 #JacksonWang #TEAMWANGRecords #iMeAsia #iMePhilippines #iMePhilippines",
